@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-a-token-from-the-login-response-here

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Log in (seeded Development users, see Data/UserSeedData.json)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lisa", "password": "Pa$$w0rd" }

### Public: list parking spaces
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/parking

### Reserve a parking space (authenticated)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/parking/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parkingSpaceId": 1, "reservationTime": "2030-01-01T10:00:00Z", "duration": 60 }

### Check one of your invoices (authenticated)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/payment/check/INV1-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Moderation queue (Admin only)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
